      "name": "正在 progressive, 更/最 degree, 或者 vs 还是",
      "explain": "正在 before a verb shows an action is in progress right now. 更 (\"more\") and 最 (\"most\") go before an adjective to show degree. Use 或者 for \"or\" in statements, but 还是 for \"or\" inside a question.",
